WEBVTT

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.625
<i>Coppelia's casket</i>

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:15.875
<i>The flowing tears have already dried up</i>

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:19.083
<i>Solitude starved for blood</i>

00:00:19.083 --> 00:00:25.292
<i>Death dances, smelling of angel down</i>

00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:38.042
<i>In a town where the black sun never sets</i>

00:00:38.042 --> 00:00:45.458
<i>Everyone works silently with an air of deception</i>

00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:49.125
<i>I cannot meet you</i>

00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:52.833
<i>I cannot meet you here</i>

00:00:52.833 --> 00:01:00.125
<i>God, our savior</i>

00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:03.333
<i>Coppelia's casket</i>

00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:07.500
<i>People are dolls tired of dancing</i>

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.792
<i>The lamb on the altar</i>

00:01:10.792 --> 00:01:17.000
<i>Where is the mechanical dream headed?</i>

00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:21.875
<i>Coppelia's casket</i>

00:01:21.875 --> 00:01:25.917
<i>O light awakened from the darkness</i>

00:01:25.917 --> 00:01:29.208
<i>The lamb on the altar</i>

00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:36.125
<i>Where is the dream with</i>
<i>the broken spring headed?</i>

00:01:41.708 --> 00:01:43.750
Noir...

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:47.042
It is the name of an ancient fate.

00:01:47.042 --> 00:01:50.417
Two maidens who govern death.

00:01:50.417 --> 00:01:52.750
The peace of the newly born,

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:55.083
their black hands protect.

00:02:38.292 --> 00:02:41.500
"Make a pilgrimage for the past with me."

00:02:42.542 --> 00:02:45.000
A pilgrimage to the past?

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.042
Whatever. This is stupid.

00:03:09.833 --> 00:03:13.208
"Maidens with Black Hands"

00:04:23.583 --> 00:04:25.083
Tell me.

00:04:44.458 --> 00:04:46.958
Who in the world are you?

00:07:10.375 --> 00:07:12.042
That's as far as you go.

00:07:16.083 --> 00:07:17.833
Some pilgrimage.

00:07:19.542 --> 00:07:21.625
I'm only going to ask one more time.

00:07:21.625 --> 00:07:25.042
Who are you?

00:07:25.042 --> 00:07:26.417
Noir.

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:31.000
I've been waiting for you.

00:08:11.375 --> 00:08:12.875
That little...

00:08:42.625 --> 00:08:45.167
Are they after me?

00:08:45.167 --> 00:08:46.833
No.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.417
Don't tell me that she did them all.

00:11:03.458 --> 00:11:07.458
I can kill people.

00:11:07.458 --> 00:11:09.833
So easily.

00:11:11.792 --> 00:11:15.292
But then why...

00:11:15.292 --> 00:11:17.625
...don't I feel sad?

00:11:47.208 --> 00:11:49.208
That should do it.

00:11:49.208 --> 00:11:52.833
Thank you. You seem very
familiar with treating wounds.

00:11:52.833 --> 00:11:55.292
Were you once a nurse or something?

00:11:55.292 --> 00:11:57.750
I don't know.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:01.125
So this is your home?

00:12:01.125 --> 00:12:04.042
But it isn't your home.

00:12:10.833 --> 00:12:12.500
Kirika Yumura...

00:12:12.833 --> 00:12:13.500
"Identification Card: Kirika Yumura"

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:16.125
"Identification Card: Kirika Yumura"
That's my name.

00:12:16.125 --> 00:12:18.750
And that isn't your real name either.

00:12:20.542 --> 00:12:23.375
I've done some checking up on you.

00:12:23.375 --> 00:12:30.583
The Yumura family of three bought
this house half a year ago and moved in.

00:12:30.583 --> 00:12:34.458
Soon after, your parents went
to America to their new job posts.

00:12:34.458 --> 00:12:38.542
And you live here alone, attending school.

00:12:41.708 --> 00:12:45.542
But it was all a lie.

00:12:45.542 --> 00:12:47.792
The documents that were
submitted to public offices

00:12:47.792 --> 00:12:49.833
and the school were all forgeries.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:55.625
Your family register,
your parents' workplaces...

00:12:55.625 --> 00:12:58.667
None of it actually exists.

00:12:58.667 --> 00:13:01.208
The Yumura husband and
wife disappeared immediately

00:13:01.208 --> 00:13:03.750
under the pretext of moving overseas.

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:07.083
Someone was pretending to be your parents.

00:13:10.542 --> 00:13:14.875
Who are you? Where did you come
from and what were you doing here?

00:13:20.833 --> 00:13:23.083
Is something wrong?

00:13:23.083 --> 00:13:29.167
I don't know why I can do things like this.

00:13:29.167 --> 00:13:30.958
And that's not all.

00:13:34.667 --> 00:13:37.958
I...

00:13:37.958 --> 00:13:40.000
...don't know anything.

00:13:50.917 --> 00:13:54.917
When I came to, I was here.

00:13:57.625 --> 00:14:00.542
Who am I?

00:14:00.542 --> 00:14:02.875
I am Noir.

00:14:04.833 --> 00:14:08.542
Beyond that, I know nothing.

00:15:05.458 --> 00:15:08.667
And I found this.

00:15:14.125 --> 00:15:15.958
That isn't all.

00:15:18.292 --> 00:15:21.917
I know even more terrible things.

00:15:21.917 --> 00:15:25.000
I do. Why?

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:38.542
You don't remember anything about yourself.

00:15:38.542 --> 00:15:40.042
What about me?

00:15:45.958 --> 00:15:51.500
Mireille Bouquet, a most
trustworthy assassin for hire.

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:52.875
I see.

00:15:52.875 --> 00:15:57.667
Then shall we move on
to the more important topic?

00:15:57.667 --> 00:16:00.833
I know you found more than just this gun.

00:16:03.958 --> 00:16:09.625
You have one more thing that you're hiding.

00:16:11.875 --> 00:16:13.375
Take it out.

00:17:07.875 --> 00:17:09.417
Stop it.

00:17:14.417 --> 00:17:16.458
You know, don't you?

00:17:21.125 --> 00:17:23.083
You know...

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.750
And then...

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:18.125
You contacted me.

00:19:33.958 --> 00:19:36.083
Some pilgrimage.

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:42.000
Noir...

00:19:46.042 --> 00:19:50.375
A pilgrimage to your past and mine.

00:19:55.917 --> 00:19:57.708
One...

00:19:57.708 --> 00:20:01.125
My job is to kill people.

00:20:01.125 --> 00:20:03.000
Not to help them.

00:20:06.917 --> 00:20:08.750
Two...

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:12.917
I have always worked alone.

00:20:12.917 --> 00:20:13.917
And I intend to keep it--

00:20:13.917 --> 00:20:17.000
Please lend me your help, Mireille.

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:22.333
What in the world am I? Just until...

00:20:22.333 --> 00:20:24.333
Until I find that answer.

00:20:57.125 --> 00:21:00.458
I've made the arrangements
to leave the country.

00:21:00.458 --> 00:21:02.125
Thank you.

00:21:10.792 --> 00:21:12.542
Haven't you had enough?

00:21:14.833 --> 00:21:16.958
I can't understand

00:21:16.958 --> 00:21:19.708
why you'd bid your fond
farewells in a place like this.

00:21:21.417 --> 00:21:26.500
"Even when I was in a crowd,
I was always alone."

00:21:28.750 --> 00:21:33.208
That isn't mine. It was Ernest Hemingway.

00:21:34.833 --> 00:21:37.333
Let's go, Mireille.

00:21:57.458 --> 00:22:00.625
You know what I do for a living.

00:22:00.625 --> 00:22:03.042
I cannot let you live.

00:22:03.042 --> 00:22:05.125
You know that, don't you?

00:22:05.125 --> 00:22:06.708
Yes...

00:22:06.708 --> 00:22:10.000
All right, I'll team up with you.

00:22:13.208 --> 00:22:18.042
They are sure to come after us again.

00:22:18.042 --> 00:22:22.458
There's something I want to ask them.

00:22:22.458 --> 00:22:25.125
When that's over,

00:22:25.125 --> 00:22:27.542
I will kill you.

00:22:29.833 --> 00:22:33.875
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:55.542
<i>The soft touch</i>

00:22:55.542 --> 00:23:08.250
<i>Finally made me realize how cold my cheek was</i>

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:14.083
<i>Like waking up in the morning</i>

00:23:14.083 --> 00:23:23.250
<i>And noticing the birds</i>
<i>chirping for the first time</i>

00:23:23.250 --> 00:23:26.125
<i>Suddenly</i>

00:23:26.125 --> 00:23:30.250
<i>I don't know anything yet</i>

00:23:32.333 --> 00:23:38.708
<i>What my heart is seeking</i>

00:23:38.708 --> 00:23:42.042
<i>I don't know</i>

00:23:42.042 --> 00:23:47.208
<i>I was always looking up at the sky</i>

00:23:47.208 --> 00:23:54.458
<i>Like this, since who knows when</i>

00:23:54.458 --> 00:24:07.542
<i>I would send my thoughts</i>
<i>to right below that cloud</i>

00:24:13.458 --> 00:24:14.917
"Preview"
"The land overflows with grief"

00:24:19.417 --> 00:24:20.625
"and man commits wicked
deed upon wicked deed"

00:24:24.375 --> 00:24:25.583
"Heaven maintains its silence"

00:24:27.208 --> 00:24:28.523
"Daily Bread"
